# The build context is tarred and sent to the daemon on every build. Without
# the first two entries that is 17 GB, most of it a virtualenv the image never
# uses and models that arrive by bind mount at runtime, not through the image.
.venv
.venv-tts
voice_models

# The laptop half: microphone, iGPU, MPRIS, the focused window. Never in a
# container.
servitor_local_notebook

